  "notes": "# Rove 0.1.17\n\n- Set up Folder Auth and variables from Folder settings. Requests can inherit\n  authentication from their Folder, and descendants can use saved Folder\n  variables.\n- Add Folder Setup and Teardown to HTTP and GraphQL runs. Regression Suites\n  can enable either hook independently for each appearance of a Folder.\n  Reports include Folder step outcomes.\n- Inspect Response Steps in execution order. Rove opens the first failed\n  item and shows evidence for the selected Call request, Wait, Capture,\n  Assertion, or Script. A lone Check schema opens directly with a link to\n  the response body.\n- Preview a Request or Case referenced by a Script and navigate to its\n  current definition.\n- Reduce editing and browsing work in Steps, Cases, History, Regression\n  reports, and workspace draft handling.\n\nFolder settings, inherited Request Auth, and per-appearance Suite controls\nuse newer file formats. Update clients before sharing workspaces that use\nthose features.\n\nThis beta update targets macOS Apple Silicon. The minimum supported version is 0.1.16.\n",
